            "image": "shopify://shop_images/key_message.svg",
            "content": "<p>Key Points to include in the messaging:</p><p></p><ul><li>Easy installation of the triple-filter showerhead for the purest head-to-toe hydration.</li><li>Reduces chlorine, heavy metals & contaminants that irritate the skin, for an overall more hydrated, clearer skin.</li><li>Reduces limescale buildup which can dry out skin & hair, for smoother & softer skin and tresses.</li><li>Customizable water flow settings: Rainfall, Massage and Power Spray</li></ul>",
