            "heading": "Creative Direction",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/direction.svg",
            "content": "<ul><li>High-quality, bright lighting and high-resolution imagery/ videography to be supplied. No obvious filters.</li><li>Qure Shower filter to be the feature of the post. The background must be clean and bright.</li><li>When using the product, please do not wear any makeup, or no visible/noticeable makeup. Please include a clip of the filter installation and a before and after of your hair/skin.</li><li>In cover photos for video content always show yourself using the Qure Shower filter, unless otherwise agreed on with Qure’s team.</li></ul>",
            "wistia_id": ""
