            "heading": "Product Details",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/search.svg",
            "content": "<p>Triple the Filtration Tech (for Triple the Clean)</p><ul><li>Carbon Fiber Layer - Removes up to 99% of chlorine, reducing skin irritation and dryness, leaving your skin and hair healthier.</li><li>KDF Layer - Targets and removes heavy metals like lead and mercury, providing cleaner water for your shower.</li><li>FOF (Filter of Future) - Helps reduce the buildup of hard water minerals such as calcium and magnesium, preventing scale and improving water flow.</li></ul>",
