            "style": "default",
            "heading": "Preparing Your Shower Head",
            "content": "<ul><li>Remove the old shower head and clean the pipe. The Qure Shower Filter has a 2.5 GPM restrictor pre-installed. For compliance with stricter regulations in California, Colorado, Hawaii, Massachusetts, New York, Oregon, Rhode Island, Vermont, and Washington, replace it with the included 1.8 GPM restrictor. Check local guidelines for water flow requirements.</li></ul>",
            "code": ""
